1. e4 { White claims central space and opens lines for development. } 1... e5 { Black makes the corresponding central claim. } 2. Nf3 { White develops a knight while attacking e5. } 2... Nc6 { Black develops a knight that protects e5. } *

[Event "Openings, Explained: lesson 2"]
