2. Nf3 { The knight develops with an attack on e5. } 2... Nc6 { Black protects e5 with another developing move. } 3. Bc4 { The bishop joins the game on a diagonal toward the Black king’s side. } 3... Nf6 { Black develops and attacks White’s e4 pawn. } *

