4. O-O { White brings the king to g1 and the rook to f1 in one move. } 4... Nf6 { Black develops with pressure on e4. } 5. d3 { White supports e4 and opens the c1 bishop’s diagonal. } 5... d6 { Black supports e5 and releases the c8 bishop. } *

