3. Nc3 { White develops and attacks the queen at the same time. } 3... Qa5 { Black moves the queen away from the attack. } 4. d4 { White builds a central pawn presence and frees the c1 bishop. } 4... Nf6 { Black begins developing a knight toward the center. } *

[Event "Openings, Explained: lesson 5"]
