3. Qh5 { White threatens Qxf7#, combining queen and bishop. } 3... Nf6 { This developing move attacks the queen but does not stop its mating capture. } 4. Qxf7# { The queen captures on f7. The c4 bishop protects it, so the Black king cannot take it. } 1-0

